* EMHELO1 -- EDM welcome screen
* Populated by EMHL (COBOL) and EMHI (REXX) via SEND MAP FROM.
* All field values come from the program; this map is layout only.
MAP EMHELO1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD BANNER   AT 1,1  LEN 60 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD USERID   AT 3,10 LEN 8  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD GREETING AT 5,5  LEN 40 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD ANNRANK  AT 7,5  LEN 20 PROT DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD FOOTER   AT 23,2 LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
